      "content": "yeah i think you're right about the stress thing. i've been super tense lately. i'm not feeling any fever or swallowing issues or anything like that, just that weird heavy feeling in my jaw/neck area. do you think it could just be a dental thing or maybe like a pinched nerve from sitting weird on the couch? it's not really like an emergency or anything since my chest feels fine.",
